# --- Someone else's copyrighted material: never goes into a dump ---
# The whole of reference/, not just reference/private/ — it is a local-only
# cache of Berkeley Systems' SDKs and Apple's firmware, and .gitignore already
# excludes it wholesale. Disk images belong here for the same reason: at 15 MB
# an original After Dark image sits under the 50 MB maxFileSize and would
# otherwise be swept into the dump whole.
/reference/
*.ROM
*.img
*.iso
*.iso.zip

